MGARDx -- vendored into SZ3
===========================

Upstream:  https://github.com/lxAltria/MGARDx (Xin Liang's standalone
           reimplementation of the MGARD multigrid transform)

Vendored files:

    correction.hpp  decompose.hpp  recompose.hpp  reorder.hpp  utils.hpp

Modifications made by the SZ3 project:

1. Subsetting. Only the forward/inverse multigrid transform is vendored.
   Quantization, entropy coding, and lossless backends are SZ3's own modules
   (LinearQuantizer, BitplaneEncoder, Lossless_zstd).
2. Namespace change. Wrapped in `namespace SZ3::MGARD`.
3. Include-path and include-guard rewrites to match SZ3 conventions.

`MGARDHeaderOnly.hpp` was written by the SZ3 project and is not upstream code.

Citation: X. Liang et al., "MGARD+: Optimizing Multilevel Methods for
Error-bounded Scientific Data Reduction," IEEE TC, 2022. Algorithmic credit for
the MGARD method belongs to the MGARD line of work (Ainsworth, Tugluk, Whitney,
Archibald), though no code from those projects is vendored here.
